{
  "key": "pr-1486",
  "fields": {
    "summary": "fix(prompts): make shared instructions tracker-neutral (#1477)",
    "description": "Closes #1477\n\n### Summary\n- Replace unconditional Jira markup and CLI requirements in shared prompt/instruction files (`instructions/intake/description_template.md`, `instructions/common/acceptance_criteria_quality.md`, `instructions/common/jira_context.md`, `instructions/intake/workflow.md`, `instructions/story_test_automation/output_rules.md`, `instructions/story_questions/output_rules.md`, `instructions/common/markup_placeholder_rules.md`, `instructions/common/input_context_reading.md`, `prompts/acceptance_criteria_prompt.md`, `prompts/story_solution_prompt.md`) with tracker-neutral wording that defers formatting and commands to the active tracker's injected instructions.\n- Regenerate prompt snapshots in `snapshots/`.\n- Add unit test assertions in `js/unit-tests/test_instructionRefs.js`."
  }
}

#!/usr/bin/env node
/**
 * Generate aggregated prompt snapshots for all agent JSON configs.
